### ================================================================
### SkillNexis MERN Stack — Week 3 Assignment 1: Full Stack To-Do API
### Automated REST Client Test Suite (`requests.http`)
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Healthcheck / Server Status
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name healthCheck
GET http://localhost:5000/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. User Registration
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Alex Johnson",
  "email": "alex.johnson@skillnexis.example",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. User Login (Captures JWT Token for subsequent requests)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alex.johnson@skillnexis.example",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Extract Token from Login Response
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Get Current User Profile (Protected)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getCurrentUser
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Create First To-Do Task (High Priority)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createTodo1
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Complete Week 3 Full Stack Integration Assignment",
  "description": "Connect React Vite frontend to Express backend and test JWT authentication flow.",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### Capture Created Task ID
@firstTodoId = {{createTodo1.response.body.data._id}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Create Second To-Do Task (Medium Priority)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createTodo2
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Review Multer file upload documentation",
  "description": "Understand diskStorage, fileFilter for MIME validation, and size constraints.",
  "priority": "medium",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-12T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Create Third To-Do Task (Low Priority)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createTodo3
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Read React 19 documentation updates",
  "description": "Explore new hooks like useActionState and optimistic updates.",
  "priority": "low"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Get All To-Dos for Current User (Includes Stats)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getAllTodos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Filter To-Dos by Status (Active / Pending)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getActiveTodos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Filter To-Dos by Priority (High)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getHighPriorityTodos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Search To-Dos by Keyword
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name searchTodos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?search=Integration
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. Get Single To-Do by ID
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getSingleTodo
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{firstTodoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. Update To-Do Details
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateTodo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{firstTodoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Complete Week 3 Full Stack Integration Assignment (UPDATED)",
  "description": "Updated description with verified endpoints and documentation.",
  "priority": "high",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. Toggle To-Do Completion Status
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name toggleTodo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{firstTodoId}}/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. Delete To-Do Task
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name deleteTodo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{firstTodoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 16. Negative Test: Access Protected Route Without Token (Expect 401)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testUnauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 17. Negative Test: Register with Existing Email (Expect 400)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testDuplicateEmail
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Alex Duplicate",
  "email": "alex.johnson@skillnexis.example",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
